{"2506530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "It Has My Face", "steam_appid": 2506530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/f89fa4a61f19481f83135e45a656452c.avif?t=1781711246\" width=612 height=220 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The full version of IT HAS MY FACE is officially out!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face this collapsing world head-on and determine who survives it. This final release brings a lot of new content, including the long awaited final two chapters that complete the story, as well as two brand‑new multiplayer modes supporting up to 8 players. You’ll also find new maps, mutators, and monstrous behaviours that will make each round more thrilling than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IT HAS YOUR FACE</strong>. Now it wants your life. Hide, seek, and try to kill your clone in this deceptively simple first-person horror roguelite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/05526248c7c3444f815b2f493671592d.avif?t=1781711246\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras_big/05526248c7c3444f815b2f493671592d.webp?t=1781711246 width=1560 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your clone is hiding among the crowd, ready to kill you when you’re most vulnerable. Endure procedural paranoia as you search to find your doppelganger before they find you. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/5c8b9804864a44e173acb0b3b6c9b947.poster.avif?t=1781711246\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/5c8b9804864a44e173acb0b3b6c9b947.webm?t=1781711246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/5c8b9804864a44e173acb0b3b6c9b947.mp4?t=1781711246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/1187ed730800239bb4a7ea9296648f46.avif?t=1781711246\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras_big/1187ed730800239bb4a7ea9296648f46.webp?t=1781711246 width=1560 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Scavenge for weapons, manage limited ammo, and prepare carefully to strike. If your assassination fails, you’ll lose the opportunity to stalk from the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/8931be4ddc1452744d8f1a564184dff1.poster.avif?t=1781711246\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/8931be4ddc1452744d8f1a564184dff1.webm?t=1781711246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/8931be4ddc1452744d8f1a564184dff1.mp4?t=1781711246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src